  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;djande system revision av AEGIS fredsskapande p</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supportive System Audit of AEGIS Peacemaking Proj</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen best&#xe5;r av en revision av Aegis Trust interna kontrollsystem som st&#xf6;d till beredningen f&#xf6;r den f&#xf6;rberedande fasen av projektet: Fredsskapande efter folkmord - st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r en Rwandisk sammanh&#xe5;llning (51160033). Uppdraget genomf&#xf6;rs av konsultfirman Professional Management AB och har upphandlats via Sida&#xb4;s ramverk (F92007).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment is a review of Aegis Trust&#xb4;s internal control system, as part of the appraisal of the preparatory phase of the Peace making after Genocide - building Rwandan unity project (51160033). The assignment is carried out by the consultancy company Professional Management AB and procured through Sida&#xb4;s Framework (F92007).</narrative>
  </description>
